      "writtenOn": "2023-01-10T07:15:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are two resolution failed cases \n1. RemoteException: This should be an internal error really.\n2. ServiceSpecificException: See the error details below. I think this should be a race condition that id has been removed from client(maybe the resolution just replied on previous event). So maybe add a new error(FAILURE_ALREADY_INACTIVE?) for this case.\n\nTo match these two cases, I think use FAILURE_ALREADY_INACTIVE for both should be better. WDYT?\n\nhttps://source.corp.google.com/aosp-master/frameworks/libs/net/common/netd/binder/android/net/mdns/aidl/IMDns.aidl;l\u003d103",
      "parentUuid": "c4693958_9b6f7226",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 463,
        "startChar": 57,
        "endLine": 463,
        "endChar": 79
      },
      "revId": "50c40927bb92c16e7d1a89fb1e8eec466f439f26",
